{"stream": "process", "run_id": "run-ba410d77cff741d8", "event": "run_summary", "ts": 1787750425.9864237, "trigger_id": null, "events_received": 1, "routed": 1, "discarded": 0, "routing_errors": 0, "discards_by_reason": {}, "dispatched_ok": 1, "dispatched_failed": 0, "duration_ms": 4799.08}
{"stream": "process", "run_id": "run-9a531a735bf24a58", "event": "routing_decision", "ts": 1787750445.242811, "trigger_id": "trg-d3c776b830fa5717b6cd06ef", "decision": "route", "agent": "email", "endpoint": "https://uniformly-spongy-unpadded.ngrok-free.dev/email/campaign", "route_id": "R2-lead-context", "property_name": "lead_context", "property_value": "In April 2025, Transcarent finalized its $621 million merger with Accolade, and the combined organization now serves over 20 million members and 1,700 clients — making it one of the largest AI-powered health navigation platforms in the employer market. The WISeR controversy lands directly on Transcarent/Accolade's core terrain: the combined company uses generative AI to enable doctors, nurses, and specialists to be more productive, handling much of the administrative work so clinicians can focus on patients, and WayFinding provides clinical guidance with human support always nearby, while a pre-visit AI assistant gathers history and structures inputs for the clinician to review — reducing burden without replacing the human decision. That design philosophy — AI assembles, humans decide — maps closely to the safeguards our post argues are now the regulatory and reputational baseline. But the post-merger integration is actively scaling agentic AI capabilities: Transcarent unveiled a Total Recall Memory Engine and an agentic AI platform that \"orchestrates multiple agents\" to actively manage tasks for members. As this agentic footprint grows, the governance question sharpens — particularly given new state laws, including in Texas, Arizona, and Maryland, prohibiting fully automated denials without human oversight. A strong opening question: as Transcarent integrates Accolade's clinical and advocacy workflows into an increasingly agentic platform, where specifically are the human review checkpoints and audit trails documented today?", "event_id": "693902142", "object_id": "533994194677", "attempt_number": 0, "basis": "property + value matched a route in agents_registry.yaml"}
