ayFinding platform at CES in January 2026, suggesting active backend development where request-level debugging and correlated log visibility would be high-value. A good opening question: *As Accolade's systems continue merging into the Transcarent platform, how is your engineering team currently handling observability and request-level debugging across the APIs that connect those legacy services?*", "event_id": "3171700627", "object_id": "533994194677", "attempt_number": 0, "basis": "property + value matched a route in agents_registry.yaml"}
